Package: zufax
Title: Facts About the Host, Container and Runtime
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Reports facts about the operating system, hardware,
    virtualization, containers, 'Kubernetes' pods, 'Azure', and the 'R' and
    'Python' runtimes on 'Linux', 'macOS' and 'Windows'. Reports the CPU
    cores and memory the current process can actually use under 'Linux'
    control group ('cgroup') limits and CPU affinity, side by side with host
    values, so thread pools and memory budgets can be sized correctly inside
    containers. Also lists installed system, 'R' and 'Python' packages, and
    provides a cheap CPU and memory usage probe for log messages. Makes no
    network requests unless cloud instance metadata is explicitly requested.
